    "answer": {
      "short": "9924 students",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}60\\%\\text{ of }16\\,540&=\\frac{60}{100}\\times\\frac{16\\,540}{1}\\\\60\\%\\text{ of }16\\,540&=\\frac{3}{5}\\times16\\,540\\\\60\\%\\text{ of }16\\,540&=9924\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 9924 state high-school students in Sunview.",
